ar Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dignity_intact.\" title=\"Dignity intact.\">Dignity intact.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The leprechaun or the lesbian.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phoenix.\" title=\"Phoenix.\">Phoenix.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Residue_around_the_hoof.\" title=\"Residue around the hoof.\">Residue around the hoof.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_wind-dried_puffin.\" title=\"A wind-dried puffin.\">A wind-dried puffin.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spoony_Neeson.\" title=\"Spoony Neeson.\">Spoony Neeson.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boing_boing.\" title=\"Boing boing.\">Boing boing.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Their_water%27s_so_delicious.\" title=\"Their water&#39;s so delicious.\">Their water's so delicious.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The leprechaun or the lesbian.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ee/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian..png/revision/latest?cb=20210125094547\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The leprechaun or the lesbian.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ee/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094547\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ee/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094547 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ee/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210125094547 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The leprechaun or the lesbian.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian..png\" data-image-name=\"The leprechaun or the lesbian..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">5</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\">Sally Phillips</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dignity_intact.\" title=\"Dignity intact.\">Dignity intact.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phoenix.\" title=\"Phoenix.\">Phoenix.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The leprechaun or the lesbian.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">Series 5</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 20 September 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\">Sally Phillips</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"The leprechaun or the lesbian\" was something <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> said, when asking Greg to choose the winner of the <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_best_rainbow_scene\" title=\"Paint the best rainbow scene\">Paint the best rainbow scene</a> task. The slice of bread hanging on a washing line in the title card is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Slice_the_loaf_as_neatly_as_possible\" title=\"Slice the loaf as neatly as possible\">Slice the loaf as neatly as possible</a> task, potentially alluding to <a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\">Aisling Bea</a>'s attempt specifically where she cut her finger and got some blood on the bread.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Den lede nisse eller den lesbiske', which translates as 'The mean elf or the lesbian'. Since leprechauns do not exist in Danish folklore, 'mean elf' is the closest equivalent.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Haltia tai lesbo', which translates as 'The elf or the lesbian'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_leprechaun_or_the_lesbian.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Aisling Bea</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Bob Mortimer</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mark_Watson\" title=\"Mark Watson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mark Watson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nish_Kumar\" title=\"Nish Kumar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nish Kumar</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sally Phillips</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hippest_item_of_headwear\" title=\"Hippest item of headwear\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Hippest item of headwear.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_best_coconut-flinging_machine\" title=\"Make the best coconut-flinging machine\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the best coconut flinging machine.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Paint_the_best_rainbow_scene\" title=\"Paint the best rainbow scene\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Paint the best rainbow scene. You may not open the lab door until the task is complete.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Slice_the_loaf_as_neatly_as_possible\" title=\"Slice the loaf as neatly as possible\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>There is a loaf of bread in the lab. Slice the loaf as neatly as possible. You may use one tool only and that tool must be found in this caravan.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Achieve_the_greatest_splat\" title=\"Achieve the greatest splat\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Achieve the greatest splat. One teammate must be splatted for t